<title>JAPAN: Cosmo Oil 80,000 bpd topper to be closed on Friday.</title>
<headline>Cosmo Oil 80,000 bpd topper to be closed on Friday.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cosmo Oil Co Ltd said on Thursday that it will close a 80,000 barrel-per-day (bpd) crude distillation unit at its Yokkaichi refinery in central Japan's Mie Prefecture on Friday for scheduled maintenance checks.</p>
<p>The unit will resume operations on November 14, a Cosmo spokesman said.</p>
<p>No maintenance closure is scheduled this year for the other topper at the plant, which has a crude processing capacity of 75,000 bpd, he added.</p>
</text>
